WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.450
We're having a meeting at school today~!

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.550
Are you really that excited about going to school-kuru?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.420
Yeah!

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:13.020
I'm really looking forward to seeing all my classmates again!

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.720
I'm ultra happy!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.590
Good morning!

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.560
No!

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.030
Not interested, okay? Don't wanna see it!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.260
What's wrong?

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:28.800
I was just talking about this book I was reading yesterday, and Nao-chan suddenly...

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.740
...does that.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.240
Nao really isn't fond of ghost stories or anything of their kind.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.810
Ghosts, huh...?

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.810
I can't say I like them either...

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.280
Ain't exactly settin' a good example for the soccer team, Miss Crybaby.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.320
They're scary, alright? Not my fault!

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.390
A'ight, how about <i>this</i> for an idea?

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.260
What?

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:53.660
I think somebody needs a good hazin'!

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.610
Hazing?!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.530
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.370
Smile Precure!

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:04.270
Let's go!

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:05.800
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.940
All together!

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.540
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.740
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.410
Smile Precure!

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:18.250
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:23.690
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.890
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.830
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.770
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:39.740
So bright!

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:44.940
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:51.380
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.880
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.050
Let's go!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.750
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.690
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:03.490
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.060
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:06.860
Everybody!

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:11.070
Fly to the future!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.570
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.740
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.040
Smile Precure!

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:29.870
"Real Life School Spooks", eh-da wasa?

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:35.440
I didn't know the human world had such scary phenomena-da wasa!

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:45.250
Th-That didn't scare me one bit, you know-da wasa!

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:51.960
Though... if I put these spooky stories to good use,

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:55.480
I'm certain I could get some Bad Energy out of these schoolkids-da wasa!

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.700
As I'm sure you already know, summer vacation is almost over.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.940
Don't forget to finish your homework!

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.790
Alright, I'll see you all back again on opening day.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.330
Okay!

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:19.660
So, how are we going to haze Nao?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.360
Hrm... let's see...

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.930
Do we really have to do this?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.260
Course we do. We gotta teach you a lesson!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.470
And the lesson is "Don't be afraid of ghosts!"

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:35.440
I'm alright with the idea of monsters and stuff, but ghosts...

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.170
I'm not scared of any of them-kuru!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.780
But, how are we gonna do this...?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:47.350
A number of scary stories about the school <i>do</i> get submitted to the student council.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.450
Perhaps we could investigate them one by one.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.500
Hey, nice idea!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.920
That sounds really fun!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.120
Not seeing the fun at all here!

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:03.130
Hey, see it this way. If we keep scarin' ya, it'll build up a resistance!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.970
That's not how it works! Who said I <i>want</i> resistance, anyway?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:12.810
Those stupid Precures... you've picked a good time for your little hazing-da wasa!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.310
We'll try something a little different today-da wasa...

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.080
Super Akanbe!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.050
The first story is about the music room here.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:31.360
Rumor has it that sometimes the piano can be heard playing, even though nobody is in the room.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.200
Yeah, my elementary school had a rumor like that too...

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:39.130
These types of rumors tend to stir up unneccessary disquiet among the students.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:42.840
And as vice president of the student council, it is my duty to put them to rest.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.950
You would see it like that...

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.610
Of course! There's no such thing as ghosts anyway.

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:51.610
You think so? I believe in them...

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:52.810
That's stupid!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:53.750
No it's not!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.830
I'm just not good with this scary stuff, alright?!

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.490
I'm not scared of any ghosts-kuru!

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.190
Come on, get movin'!

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.240
What was that?!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:21.290
I dropped the Piano Décor!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.100
Let's Go: Piano!

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.290
Well played!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.060
Do you really think this is the time for a piano?!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.230
But I like playing the piano!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.730
But <i>right now</i> is not the time!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:45.470
We know Nao's a wuss, but this ain't what I'd expect from you, Miyuki.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.620
I've really got to get over this...

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.380
Alright! I'm going to get over this stupid phobia!

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.030
That's more like it, Nao!

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:58.280
You've gotta try and be brave too, Miyuki-kuru!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.760
A-Alright...

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.320
Not exactly confident, though...

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.020
Hold it!

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.130
What happened?

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.320
T-T-The keys just started moving!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.590
You messing with us?

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.450
Seriously!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:47.720
The piano just started playing itself, I'm telling you!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.170
It does seem a little far-fetched...

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:51.960
See?

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.740
I'm telling you, it really did!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.180
Maybe it really was a ghost!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.910
I'm not scared at all-kuru!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.110
Don't be silly. Ain't no such thing as ghosts.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:07.250
I'm telling you, it really happened!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.130
It could be that you were merely jumping at shadows.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:16.660
If you're in a state of heightened tension, the slightest sound can be incredibly frightening.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.130
B-But...

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.330
So, where we going next?

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.840
The answer lies just around the corner.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.780
They say that this mirror is a gateway into another world.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.780
Another world?!

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:35.580
Indeed.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:41.550
If you look into the mirror, you may see a person's reflection that shouldn't be there.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:48.460
If you do, you will be drawn into the mirror world, never to be seen again, or so the rumor goes.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.830
I'm not scared at all-kuru!

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.610
Alright, jump to it!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.830
All part of the lesson!

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:35.000
A'ight, hold on. What now?

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.010
I-I saw it!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.450
There really was a reflection there!

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:46.850
This dark woman appeared and did <i>this!</i>

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:52.120
See? I'm telling you, ghosts really do exist!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.390
D-Don't be silly! No way it's a ghost.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.230
Perhaps it is merely paranoia.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.700
Paranoia?

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:05.800
When in a state of fear, your mind will see faces in what could just be a mark on the wall.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:08.270
Yeah, that makes sense.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.290
Oh, come on!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.940
I'm telling you, we really saw her!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.150
Yeah, sure.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.150
So, where next, Reika-chan?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.720
The art room.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.250
The art room?

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:24.890
It is rumored that the people in the pictures on the wall sometimes move.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.070
Sounds scary!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:31.060
Don't tell me... you're gonna send me and Nao-chan in there alone?

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.730
Of course! What are we here for?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:38.930
Hey! We're not going in alone! You guys are coming with us!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.610
A'ight, if ya insist.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.640
We'll be right behind ya, so come on!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.140
Now you're just making it worse!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.250
I guess those are the pictures you meant, Reika-chan?

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:52.950
I believe so...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.580
Not looking! Not looking! Not looking!

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.920
None of that! Eyes forward!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.640
Hey, no, don't!

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.700
Look at that one there...

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.800
Something's not right...

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.100
Yeah, it is weird! Come on, look, Nao!

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.950
I am looking!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.760
Look properly!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.380
She looks... familiar...

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.490
Why not treat youself to a poison apple?

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.570
Well, Reika-chan?! Try explaining that one away!

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:47.400
Yeah, seriously! Even I'm havin' trouble with that one!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.490
As am I...

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:54.110
I-I-I'm n-not scared at all-kuru!

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:56.680
How about we just drop this whole hazing thing?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.150
Yeah, this is getting way too weird for me.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.270
Guess so...

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.990
If we must, I suppose...

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:11.290
Though, there <i>is</i> just one mystery left...

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.340
What kind of mystery?!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:14.720
Well, you see...

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.700
Seriously, guys?

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.600
It's said that the skeleton model kept in the science labs...

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:29.270
Whoa... when did the school get so old-fashioned?

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.410
Is this just paranoia too...?

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:35.290
I don't believe it would work like that...

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.850
What the—?!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.530
March!

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:56.600
Akanbe!

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.020
W-Who is that...?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.770
Could it be...

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.150
...a ghost?!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:10.460
I-I'm not scared one bit-kuru!

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.530
Stop, you two!

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:17.630
Why?!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.270
You mustn't run in the hallways!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.000
Now I remember!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.010
That woman in the picture! It was Majorina!

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.110
Majorina?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:34.920
I'm sure of it! I remember she got younger when she shouted "It's Majorina Time!"...

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.090
It's Majorina Time-da wasa!

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.490
Did she really?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.230
Yeah.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:51.200
Then that would explain all the mysterious occurrences. They would all have been her handiwork.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.200
My, my...

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:01.640
It took you <i>that</i> long to figure it out? You girls truly are dense.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.350
Who are you?

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.420
It's me, Majorina, you idiots!

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:10.320
Were you not listening? She just told you I could undo my aging!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.260
She's really pretty!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:21.830
That's only natural, my dear. I <i>am</i> the most beautiful woman in all the world!

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:25.240
Whoops...

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:28.910
Majorina Time doesn't last that long-da wasa...

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:33.440
Not that it matters. Our little game ends here-da wasa!

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:37.280
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.250
...a Bad End!

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:44.450
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:59.370
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot{-sama, da wasa}!

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.480
This time, I've got my Super Akanbe ready in advance!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:12.950
Akanbe!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:12.950
Where is it?!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:17.650
I believe she may have turned the entire school into her Akanbe!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.860
Akanbe!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.990
Hurry up and transform-kuru!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.060
Right!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.030
Ready?

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:34.380
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:35.570
Go!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.570
Go, go!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.700
Let's go!

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.660
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.650
Cure Happy!

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.800
Dazzling sun!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.720
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.330
Cure Sunny!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:01.570
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.590
Cure Peace!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.850
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.900
Cure March!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.870
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.570
Cure Beauty!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:26.100
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:36.630
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:43.230
Super Akanbe! Put an end to these Precure-da wasa!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.370
Akanbe...

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.630
We need to get out of the school!

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:50.710
Right!

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:54.620
The heck?!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.350
We're getting nowhere!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.880
What on earth is happening?

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.250
Akanbe!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.490
March?!

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.790
Akanbe!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:08.960
Nooo!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.930
Akanbe!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.770
Akanbe!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.540
Akanbe!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.340
Akanbe!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.510
Don't leave me behind, March!

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:32.850
Calm down, you two!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.490
You have to stop running in the hallways!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.690
Akanbe...

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:42.560
What's the matter with you-da wasa?

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.260
Akan-Akan...

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:51.830
Akan-

00:17:52.470 --> 00:17:53.470
be...

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.310
Akan!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.140
No! You have to keep your mouth shut!

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:03.780
Akan... Akanbe...

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.880
There's a way out!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.440
Curses-da wasa!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.630
Huh? Where are we?

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.630
We're outside-kuru!

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.200
Hmph! This is where the fight really begins-da wasa!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.840
Super Akanbe, take the Precure down-da wasa!

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.310
Super Akanbe!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.440
That's...

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.740
<i>...huge!</i>

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:37.150
I knew it! She turned the entire school building into an Akanbe!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.310
Super Akanbe!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.620
Super A...

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.550
Wait...

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.660
Is that Akanbe...

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.090
...too big to move?!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:53.200
A-Akan! Akanbe!

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:54.700
It's stuck!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.200
Come on, then!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.600
Right!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:05.530
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.330
Princess Happy!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.530
Princess Sunny!

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.720
Princess Peace!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.930
Princess March!

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:31.130
Princess Beauty!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:38.730
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:48.940
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.450
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.740
Precure...

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.920
Rainbow...

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.340
Burst!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.550
Akanbe...!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.320
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:34.530
That one dropped <i>four</i> new Décors-kuru!

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:37.640
I'll get you for this!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.840
Kuru!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.480
This hazing thing's a lot of fun-kuru!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.390
That ghost turned out to just be an Akanbe...

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.890
Now I know for sure I hate horror stories...

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.830
Yeah, guess it ain't that easy to get over a phobia.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.130
I'm not scared of ghosts at all-kuru!

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.600
That's the way, Candy!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:12.250
No she's not! She was freaking out back there!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.400
I wasn't freaking out-kuru!

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.200
Yeah you were!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.900
By the way, everyone...

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:19.840
What have you chosen to do your summer report on?

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:26.520
I feel today's excursion is a good reason to look into supernatural phenomena.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:31.220
Forget the report, I've still haven't <i>started</i> my English homework...

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.920
I haven't done my math...

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:36.860
I haven't even touched my history homework...

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:40.330
I've done <i>nothing</i>!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.000
Nothing?!

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.510
What has gotten into you all?

00:21:53.810 --> 00:22:01.150
Ghosts sure are scary, but... the thought of all that homework to do is a hundred times worse!

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.720
When we rolled those dice, we got whisked off to some crazy world!

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:44.180
It appears Majorina has created some kind of game world...

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:46.780
Look at all this... Whack-a-mole, go-karts...

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.210
Wow, this seems so fun!

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:52.770
Alright then, let's beat all these games!

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:55.350
It's the Precure Team vs the Bad End Team!

00:23:55.350 --> 00:23:57.660
This time, the games will decide the winner-kuru!

00:23:57.980 --> 00:23:59.190
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.440
Find your ultra happy smile!
